You rend the very essence of the target, drawing on their life and converting it to void stars. The target takes [99, 133, 159, 182, 202 (TL1-5; SP 100)] darkness and [99, 133, 159, 182, 202 (TL1-5; SP 100)] temporal damage, and you gain [1, 1, 1, 1, 2 (TL1-5)] void star(s).

The damage will increase with your Spellpower.
